Operation: trip.set_name: Name the trip.

Arguments:
- value (trip name): What the traveler calls the trip. Required. Point at the user's own words.

Examples:
- «the trip is for the Lisbon offsite» → value: «Lisbon offsite»
- «the trip name needs changing» → value: not given

